@PAROLLES. That's it; I would have said the very same.

@LAFEU. Why, your dolphin is not lustier. 'Fore me, I speak in
respect-

@PAROLLES. Nay, 'tis strange, 'tis very strange; that is the brief
and the tedious of it; and he's of a most facinerious spirit that will not acknowledge it to be the-

@LAFEU. Very hand of heaven.

@PAROLLES. Ay; so I say.

@LAFEU. In a most weak-

@PAROLLES. And debile minister, great power, great transcendence;
which should, indeed, give us a further use to be made than alone the recov'ry of the King, as to be-

